Chapter: DateTimeX509Now
  cites Foreword chapter DateTime
  cites Foreword chapter Console

 Unix seconds to the X.509 validity clock, YYYYMMDDHHMMSS UTC, across the
 epoch, a leap day and the end of 2099.

Section: Body

  digits : List Integer -> Text
  digits (bs) = text-concat-list (for b in bs -> show (b - 48))

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
    print-line-uni (digits (unix-to-x509-now 0) & " " & digits (unix-to-x509-now (0 - 1)) & " " & digits (unix-to-x509-now 951782400)
      & " " & digits (unix-to-x509-now 1793494861) & " " & digits (unix-to-x509-now 4102444799))
  end